2152
00:06:17,397 --> 00:06:20,487
Don't you agree, Miss?

2153
00:06:22,027 --> 00:06:25,827
Even though a lot of citizens have died,
 <i>they</i> are unable to do anything about it.

2154
00:06:26,197 --> 00:06:32,037
Ever since cogito-infected autoreivs
 abandoned their duties as Entourages,

2155
00:06:32,037 --> 00:06:36,087
