Light?

2163
00:06:50,477 --> 00:06:53,357
The pillar of light we saw two months ago.

2164
00:06:53,357 --> 00:06:54,187
Ow.

2165
00:06:55,477 --> 00:06:58,487
Come to think of it, many strange things started happening

2166
00:06:58,487 --> 00:07:01,487
since the night we saw that pillar of light.

2167
00:07:08,957 --> 00:07:11,077
Please don't worry yourself.

2168
00:07:11,077 --> 00:07:13,207
It's just a rumor.

2169
00:07:13,747 --> 00:07:14,457
Hey!

2170
00:07:14,457 --> 00:07:17,627
In any case, it is in times of great hardship for Romdeau citizens

2171
00:07:17,627 --> 00:07:23,137
that we immigrants must continue to fulfill
 our duties so that we may become model citizens.

2172
00:07:24,137 --> 00:07:27,257
Please give our regards to the Administrator...

2173
00:07:27,257 --> 00:07:28,387
Chief!

2174
00:07:28,387 --> 00:07:30,387
Three infected autoreivs have been found!

2175
00:07:30,387 --> 00:07:31,767
Distance: 400.

2176
00:07:31,767 --> 00:07:33,807
To your positions!

2177
00:07:34,227 --> 00:07:37,317
We will launch an assault on the Mainland!

2178
00:07:37,727 --> 00:07:38,987
Time for a cogito hunt!

2179
00:07:38,987 --> 00:07:40,237
Well, Miss.

2180
00:07:40,237 --> 00:07:42,277
Please be careful on your way back.

2181
00:07:42,697 --> 00:07:43,907
Time to hunt infections!

2182
00:07:43,907 --> 00:07:45,777
Let's get Romdeau back!

2183
00:07:49,157 --> 00:07:51,247
<i>And where am I supposed to go back to?</i>

2184
00:07:57,167 --> 00:08:03,297
<i>They were living amidst destruction in almost pitiful ignorance.</i>

2185
00:08:04,337 --> 00:08:06,297
<i>What can they do?</i>

2186
00:08:07,297 --> 00:08:09,307
<i>Same goes for me...</i>

2187
00:08:12,137 --> 00:08:15,897
<i>Upon reaching Romdeau, Vincent Law vanished without a trace.</i>

2188
00:08:16,647 --> 00:08:20,437
<i>These past two days, whenever I saw him in the city...</i>

2189
00:08:21,027 --> 00:08:23,697
<i>he was in the form of Ergo PROXY.</i>

2190
00:08:24,657 --> 00:08:27,407
<i>It seemed as though he was possessed</i>

2191
00:08:27,407 --> 00:08:29,327
<i>by a grief that rejected all contact with others.</i>

2192
00:08:30,157 --> 00:08:33,537
<i>What was once divided must again become whole.</i>

2193
00:08:33,997 --> 00:08:37,037
<i>When Vincent becomes one with PROXY...</i>

2194
00:08:37,037 --> 00:08:42,667
<i>Will the resulting person be the Vincent I know?</i>

2195
00:08:43,257 --> 00:08:45,627
<i>And then, I would...</i>

2196
00:08:59,107 --> 00:09:00,477
Die!

2197
00:09:09,117 --> 00:09:11,787
Those of you who are model citi-ti-tizens,

2198
00:09:11,787 --> 00:09:13,947
stay in-in-in-inside and wait in your homes

2199
00:09:13,947 --> 00:09:19,877
until further instructions-ns-ns from
 the Citizen Information Bureau-eau-eau.

2200
00:09:19,877 --> 00:09:23,087
Going out without permission may result in penalty.

2201
00:09:23,087 --> 00:09:28,587
<i>I'd been bored by the current
 order in paradise and desired change.</i>

2202
00:09:29,217 --> 00:09:31,637
<i>Did my twisted desires</i>

2203
00:09:32,057 --> 00:09:37,267
<i>awaken the monster called Ergo that
 had been slumbering within Vincent?</i>

2204
00:09:38,937 --> 00:09:42,397
<i>Did everything start with me?</i>

2205
00:09:51,907 --> 00:09:53,407
Re-l Mayer.

2206
00:09:53,907 --> 00:09:56,407
Where are your primary care physician's papers?

2207
00:09:57,327 --> 00:10:00,747
Ask my Entourage for them as usual.

2208
