Doing?

2385
00:21:46,117 --> 00:21:47,497
Grandfather!

2386
00:22:07,437 --> 00:22:08,767
Piano!

2387
00:22:12,437 --> 00:22:13,897
I'm home!

2388
00:22:22,527 --> 00:22:24,237
Stop it, Vincent!

2389
00:22:24,787 --> 00:22:29,247
